### Get User's Placement
GET {{host}}/placement/student
Authorization: {{student_token}}

### Apply to job posting
POST {{host}}/placement/supervisor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

{
  "studentId": "d751eeea-5611-407a-982e-33a5353e685e",
  "supervisorId": "4ee4784a-b2ae-4b6e-926e-9d6d64ee0a18"
}

### Get User's Supervisor
GET {{host}}/placement/student/supervisor
Authorization: {{student_token}}

### Get Supervisor Students
GET {{host}}/placement/supervisor/students
Authorization: {{supervisor_token}}

### Get EMployer Interns
GET {{host}}/placement/employer/interns
Authorization: {{employer_token}}